OL,3,ADrumcree parade ban was in interests of
OL,4,Apeace, says Bryant
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland secretary of state
OL,7,Fhas said his decision to ban the Orange
OL,8,FOrder's Drumcree march was in the best
OL,9,Finterests of peace.
OL,11,FThe decision came after an agreement
OL,12,Fcouldn't be reached between the
OL,13,FPortadown District Lodge and the
OL,14,FGarvaghy Road residents over whether
OL,15,Fthe march would be allowed down the
OL,16,Fpredominantly nationalist road.
OL,18,FThe stalemate has reopened what was
OL,19,Fonce the most bitter parading dispute
OL,20,Fin Northern Ireland, with stand-offs in
OL,21,Fthe mid-to-late 1990s accompanied by
OL,22,Friots, roadblocks and killings.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
