OL,3,ASara Sharif's grandfather granted
OL,4,Aguardianship of her siblings in
OL,5,APakistan
OL,6,
OL,7,FSara Sharif's paternal grandfather has
OL,8,Fbeen granted guardianship of her
OL,9,Fsiblings by a court in Pakistan.
OL,11,FThe decision comes after years of legal
OL,12,Flimbo following the murder of
OL,13,F10-year-old Sara by her father and
OL,14,Fstepmother in 2023.
OL,16,FThe children's grandfather has said her
OL,17,Fsiblings will retain their British
OL,18,Fcitizenship so they can choose to
OL,19,Freturn to the UK if they wish.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
