CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1791641889
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARussian glide bomb attack on
OL,4,AZaporizhzhia kills at least 15 people
OL,5,
OL,6,FZelensky said 13 other regions had also
OL,7,Fbeen hit overnight, adding: "Our
OL,8,Fresponses to [these] Russian strikes
OL,9,Fwill come".
OL,11,FThe Russian attacks happened just hours
OL,12,Fafter President Donald Trump announced
OL,13,Fa deal to import Russian diesel into
OL,14,Fthe US.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
