OL,3,ATrump announces deal for Russian diesel
OL,4,Aas Zelensky calls it a gift to Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is understood the US Treasury is
OL,7,Fsuspending sanctions on Russian diesel
OL,8,Fexports until 7 April as part of the
OL,9,Fdeal, but other assets like those in
OL,10,FAmerican banks are still frozen.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
